Feature: RT-L6 harness native run — the migrated test harness runs a two-case suite over the ordinary program path, verdict-first with per-case captured output

  Scenario: two_case_suite_reports — one case passes and one fails; each verdict line is printed, the failing case's panic is captured under its own channel, and the summary counts both
    Given env = ["TEKO_BACKEND=c"]
    When built and run
    Then stdout pattern = "test alpha ... ok"
    And stdout pattern = "test beta ... FAILED"
    And stdout pattern = "err| teko: deliberate panic: assertion failed: eq_i64 — expected 2, got 1"
    And stdout pattern = "test result: FAILED. 2 ran; 1 passed; 1 failed; 0 exited"
    And exit = 0
